{title: O Heeriye}
{artist: Ayushman Khurana}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A]Jadd tainu vekhiya,        [F#m]Pehli vari main taan
[D]Tennu hi takda [A]reha,        [A]Jachda nahi si
[F#m]Tere naal main taan,        [D]Phir vi jachda [A]reha
[A]Khinchda reha tainu [E]apni ore,        [D]Tainu main kenda [A]reha
[F#m]Khinchda reha tainu [D]apni ore,        [A]Tainu main kenda [E]reha
[A]O Heeriye tainu [F#m]le jaana,        Ae [D]gal tu man ch basa
Nahi [E]jeena tere bina,        Saanu [A]de na saza
[A]O Heeriye tainu [D]le jaana,        [F#m] [E] [D] [A]
Jaane na [E] tu, aai [F#m] kyu
Teri teri [E]yaadon mein tanha [D]hua,        Tere [E]liye [F#m]saansein
[D]Chale meri zinda [E]hua,        Tu jo [A]kahe to [D]
[F#m]Paaniyon pe chal dun [A]main,        Karaan tera [D]sadka
Tera hi sajda [E]kara,        [A]O Heeriye tainu [F#m]le jaana
Ae [D]gal tu man ch basa,        Nahi [E]jeena tere bina
Saanu [A]de na saza,        [A]O Heeriye tainu [D]le jaan
[A]Heeriye, khudi se toota hai,        [F#m]Aaina jhoota hai, [D]aaraan
Bande ki bandagi [E]udi,        [D]Dekho ye zindagi [E]mudi
[A]Heeriye, khudi se toota hai,        [F#m]Aaina jhoota hai, [D]aaraan
Bande ki bandagi [E]udi,        [D]Dekho ye zindagi [E]mudi
[A]Rab ka ye tukda,        [F#m]Sona jeha mukhda
[D]Ik wari hor [A]dikha,        [A]Gham ki parat pe
[F#m]Jhooti sharat pe,        [D]Phir se jeena [A]sikha
[A]O Heeriye tainu [F#m]le jaana,        Ae [D]gal tu man ch [A]basa
